    source("datasheet", "https://d3pcsg2wjq9izr.cloudfront.net/files/60508/download/424802/1-CryoTel-DS-1.5-dataSheet-per(1).pdf", "Sunpower CryoTel DS 1.5 data sheet", ["dimensions_mm", "mass_g", "electrical", "thermal"], notes="Cold head 128 mm long x 39 mm diameter; pressure wave generator 116 mm long x 55 mm diameter; 1.2 kg total; 1.4 W nominal lift at 77 K (23 C reject) for 30 W input; 24 V dc; lowest temperature 40 K; MTTF goal 120,000 h. The two units are joined by a transfer line and can be placed apart; the catalog draws them side by side with a 6 mm gap, so the 100 x 55 x 128 mm envelope is one valid arrangement, not a vendor dimension. Earlier catalog entry called this 'DS Mini' with a placeholder box.", date="2026-11-11"),
